OL,3,GNEWSAStadium development plan set to be
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorks that would mean a major project
OL,7,Fto transform the grounds surrounding
OL,8,FReading's Select Car Leasing Stadium
OL,9,Fcan proceed are set to be given the
OL,10,Fgo-ahead.
OL,12,FThe Royal Elm Park project, which
OL,13,Fincludes 600 apartments, a 246-bedroom
OL,14,Fhotel, an ice rink and a convention
OL,15,Fcentre, was given planning permission
OL,16,Fin 2017.
OL,18,FBut Reading Borough Council must later
OL,19,Fapprove enabling works for it,
OL,20,Fincluding ensuring that land that could
OL,21,Fbe contaminated by gas and waste is
OL,22,Fmade safe.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
