OL,3,GNEWSAStadium development plan set to be
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site was previously a landfill site
OL,7,Fbetween 1972 and 1985 and was used as
OL,8,Fsurface-level parking when the stadium
OL,9,Fopened in 1998.
